<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-sanguozhi" book-id="b-sanguozhi-052" chapter-id="c-sanguozhi-052-gucheng-complete" source-id="s-sanguozhi-052-gucheng-complete">
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-052-gucheng-complete:line062" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-sanguozhi-052-gucheng-complete:line062:m0000" ref="syc_ik6_bq5_**AAB">承</persName>字<persName id="c-sanguozhi-052-gucheng-complete:line062:m0002" ref="syc_ik6_bq5_**AAB">子直</persName>，嘉禾中與舅<persName id="c-sanguozhi-052-gucheng-complete:line062:m0010" ref="36u_j3u_i3z">陸瑁</persName>俱以禮征。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-052-gucheng-complete:line062:m0017" ref="572_278_cba">權</persName>賜丞相<persName id="c-sanguozhi-052-gucheng-complete:line062:m0021" ref="syc_ik6_bq5_**A">雍</persName>書曰：「貴孫<persName id="c-sanguozhi-052-gucheng-complete:line062:m0028" ref="syc_ik6_bq5_**AAB">子直</persName>，令問休休，至與相見，過於所聞，爲君嘉之。」拜騎都尉，領羽林兵。後爲呉郡西部都尉，與<persName id="c-sanguozhi-052-gucheng-complete:line062:m0072" ref="512_1cd_a4b">諸葛恪</persName>等共平山越，別得精兵八千人，還屯軍章阬，拜昭義中郎將，入爲侍中。芍陂之役，拜奮威將軍，出領京下督。數年，與兄<persName id="c-sanguozhi-052-gucheng-complete:line062:m0129" ref="syc_ik6_bq5_**AAA">譚</persName>，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-052-gucheng-complete:line062:m0131" ref="roi_rz4_ute_A">張休</persName>等懼徙交州，年三十七卒。</p>
</text>
